<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets Astra call warrants.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets Astra call warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued two million American-style call warrants on shares of Astra Ab, lead manager Bankers Trust International Plc said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by two warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    140 SEK		   PREMIUM	18.99 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.64 DEM		  GEARING	8.85 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	23.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/BER/HAM/STUT/DUES MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  130 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
